  "releaseNotes": "Fix (Martin Honnen): streaming xsl:template match=\"/\" now fires under xsl:mode streamable=\"yes\" (the document-node template was skipped, so a built-in text-only copy ran and element output was lost). Fix (Martin Honnen / DocBook xslTNG): base URI is preserved across temporary-tree copy boundaries and fn:transform result documents, so resolve-uri()/doc() over copied or transformed nodes resolve correctly (was FORG0002). Requires PhoenixmlDb.Core 1.1.9 and PhoenixmlDb.XQuery 1.4.6. See RELEASES.md for full notes.",
